{"id":"wb-6-659","name":"鄂州观音阁","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"鄂州观音阁","text":"鄂州观音阁，又名龙蟠矶寺，位于中华人民共和国湖北省鄂州市鄂城区小东门外的长江龙蟠矶上，是一座佛道两教寺庙。观音阁始建于元代，明朝、清朝均有重修。建筑整体坐东朝西，共有3间正殿，另有一座纯阳楼和一座观澜亭。是全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%84%82%E5%B7%9E%E8%A7%82%E9%9F%B3%E9%98%81","revisionId":87158908,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=87158908","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/ee1cef5f5ea39ed0f65090ca.jpg","title":"龙蟠矶.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%BE%99%E8%9F%A0%E7%9F%B6.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3c/%E9%BE%99%E8%9F%A0%E7%9F%B6.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Huangchenhai","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​龙蟠矶，位于东门外大江中。上建有万里长江第一阁、全国重点文物保护单位观音阁","width":320,"height":180}}